                                "sense_id": "2a5a849f-b204-39b6-b0ad-cf07cfbd75cb",
                                "text": "De boeren waren blij met de wijnoogst en verwachten een uitstekende wijn te produceren.",
                                "translation": "The farmers were pleased with the wine harvest and expect to produce excellent wine.",
                                "english": "The farmers were pleased with the wine harvest and expect to produce excellent wine."
                            },
