                                "sense_id": "2a5a849f-b204-39b6-b0ad-cf07cfbd75cb",
                                "text": "Door de late vorst was de wijnoogst kleiner dan gebruikelijk.",
                                "translation": "Due to late frost, the wine harvest was smaller than usual.",
